# <type>(<scope>): <imperative subject, English, <= 72 chars>
#
# Types:  feat fix docs test refactor ci chore perf build
# Scopes: connectors mcp docs ci (optional)
# Example: fix(connectors): retry ESHOT stop lookup on HTTP 503
#
# Body: explain WHY, wrap at 72 columns.
# Footer: "BREAKING CHANGE: ...", "Refs #123".
# AI assistance: add "Co-authored-by:" only for substantive generated code;
# the human author stays responsible. See docs/development/commit-convention.md
